4252	/// Choose the capacity for a page that `grow` is about to append after
4253	/// `last`, the page that just filled up.
4254	///
4255	/// The grid size (cols and rows) is always the standard one from
4256	/// `initialCapacity`. The other dimensions (styles, graphemes, strings,
4257	/// and hyperlinks) hold variable-size data. When a page runs out of room
